p-administration-advances-first-wave-of-critical-mineral-production-projects/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;administration&amp;nbsp;efforts to increase American mineral production&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
